        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "1、微分方程的隐含信息"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                146,
                470,
                366,
                488
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "(1)阶数(特征根的个数、极点的个数): 看方程的左边, 与右边无关"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                147,
                493,
                746,
                512
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "(2)零输入响应的解形式"
                    }
